      "content": "It’s completely understandable to feel lost when the goal you lived for evaporates, leaving behind a vacuum. This feeling of meaninglessness is a sign that your internal compass needs a new direction, not just a new view. Consider what truly nourishes you when the pressure is off—what activities or connections bring you a genuine spark?",
      "source": "target",
